<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Cry For You</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Isabel LaRosa</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Raven</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">45d42op5b8Lec8TlxLFnVX</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.970" end="00:13.018">How's it feel to finally lose me, baby?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.018" end="00:16.136">Do you feel me in your empty house?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.136" end="00:19.309">Better hold onto the memory, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.309" end="00:22.229">'Cause that's all you're gonna live with now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.229" end="00:25.264">You took a good girl and broke her to pieces</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.264" end="00:28.354">'Cause you like to leave a bruise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.354" end="00:30.076">It sounds like I'm heartless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.076" end="00:31.721">Just using my heart less</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.721" end="00:34.177">'Cause that's what you made me do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.177" end="00:37.668">I won't cry for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.668" end="00:40.609">Like I did when I was yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.609" end="00:44.092">I won't lie to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.092" end="00:47.116">Just 'cause you're so insecure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.116" end="00:50.854">Oh, good luck trying to live with yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.854" end="00:53.260">You'll look for me in everyone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.260" end="00:59.604">And I won't cry for you, I won't cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.604" end="01:06.041">Cry for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.041" end="01:13.844">Cry for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.844" end="01:16.815">Yeah, you think you're such poet, darlin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.815" end="01:20.088">I hate to say it, but you're not that deep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.088" end="01:23.446">Don't pretend you're such a tortured artist</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.446" end="01:26.273">All you ever did was torture me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.273" end="01:29.255">You took a good girl and broke her to pieces</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.255" end="01:32.479">'Cause you like to leave a bruise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.479" end="01:34.028">It sounds like I'm heartless</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.028" end="01:35.684">Just using my heart less</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.684" end="01:38.212">'Cause that's what you made me do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.212" end="01:41.636">I won't cry for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.636" end="01:44.535">Like I did when I was yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.535" end="01:47.906">I won't lie to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.906" end="01:50.903">Just 'cause you're so insecure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.903" end="01:54.858">Oh, good luck trying to live with yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.858" end="01:57.191">You'll look for me in everyone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.191" end="02:03.567">And I won't cry for you, I won't cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.567" end="02:10.015">Cry for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.015" end="02:14.015">Cry for you</p></div></body></tt>